{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "b7c221a71e7acfad673aa5ebd04b0c3275c456214df4693b7d9696a17f07aa20", "ja": "忘れ物を取りに", "zh": "去拿落下的东西", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9b78ed3d4a780ad40c28cad59e061d44c57596f7441ee2af16de393497b0c327", "ja": "南エリア公演終了後、劇場へと帰る日。空港\nでお土産を選ぶ一同。翼はメンバーとお揃い\nのキーホルダーをプロデューサーに手渡す。\n皆は楽しくて心残りがあると語り、「忘れ物\nを取りに、またここへ来よう」と語り合う。", "zh": "南部地区公演结束后，大家踏上返回剧场的日子。在机场\n一行人挑选着伴手礼。翼将和成员们同款的钥匙扣递给制作人。\n大家说这次既开心又有些意犹未尽，并相约“下次再来这里\n取回遗落的东西吧”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "caab4923d8dabe0f0d07475204fba449380bcb35cdb3945e024b728efdc7548b", "ja": "（公演は無事に終了！　今日は劇場に戻る日だ。\nさて、そろそろ帰りの飛行機の時間だが……）", "zh": "（公演顺利结束！今天要回剧场了。好了，差不多该到搭返程飞机的时间了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "4cea73b89cb532f66f725d45c9bf6dd83e2ada1e79e93e92eea3be6daeb48ad9", "ja": "みんな、どこまでお土産を買いに行ったんだ……！！", "zh": "大家到底跑去多远的地方买特产了啊……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_07_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ca0b388653cffbc6a06466c771ad6209f8a46f5d32f15a42daceb9ff0b3d1a7d", "ja": "{$P$}さ～ん！\nごめんなさい、お待たせしました♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生——！\n对不起，让您久等了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_07_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ef81ecab9658373baaef6d5faa747390dc3729f6d27d9375c0ed0c96554f9a78", "ja": "あ、翼！　よかった、やっと帰って……\nいや、それにしてもすごい量のお土産だな。", "zh": "啊，翼！太好了，你终于回来了……\n不对，话说回来，你这伴手礼也太多了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_07_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "f1c53ff3e880c207209d55084d2e318e012701e50811cedfd2121111b91d126b", "ja": "いや～、なんか、気になるの多くってさ～！\nついつい、いろんなショップ回っちゃったよ。", "zh": "哎呀～就是觉得有好多东西都很吸引人嘛～！不知不觉就逛了好多家店。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_07_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "897403fa7ab12d46b9e31a3f428ab7de2662520af02b572988cd0728d253572e", "ja": "恵美ちゃん、『ご当地限定』って書いてあるお店を\n見つけるたびに入って行くから、大変だったのです。", "zh": "惠美只要一看到写着“当地限定”的店\n就会走进去，可真是折腾了一番呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_07_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "b5edd369bd7764918761cfaf72ddc7e86a9d03e3c6f04e08fd424ee72934fde5", "ja": "だって限定だよ！？\nここでしか売ってないとか、気になるじゃん！", "zh": "因为是限定商品嘛！？\n写着“仅限当地销售”之类的店，当然会忍不住想进去看看啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_07_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "d40d22908bcf6e22e782742d4ad541fd9c0e7a767c1d86c2c8656dfab36e5817", "ja": "ていうか、アタシより貴音のほうが荷物多くない？\n大丈夫なの？", "zh": "话说回来，贵音的行李不是比我还多吗？\n真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_07_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "6510f7873d0420f779ce97f7bc5d5fe2f47515817278023521a3d502d5caf79f", "ja": "名物というのはどれも美味しそうで、\n実に……悩ましく。", "zh": "特产看起来每样都十分美味，\n实在是……令人难以抉择。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_07_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b028fbbadba73da69d0ca377b7910347c7eb274088a2e36a4bd82c1c17b43343", "ja": "貴音さん、お菓子もいっぱい買ってましたよね！\nあとで味見させてくださ～い！", "zh": "贵音小姐也买了好多点心吧！待会儿请让我尝尝吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_07_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "746d2534b005bd4d4b93e93f85136609c80d4996f5742f7454e460757036eb48", "ja": "ええ。構いませんよ。\n帰ってから、皆で一緒に食べましょう。", "zh": "嗯，当然可以。回去后，大家一起吃吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_07_1011_p", "source_sha256": "3ee4fa452e0d17f433896b7bb363b5fde182748407c0285cbad7e2f8c03ef2dd", "ja": "食べ物のお土産が多いな……\n翼は、何か買ったのか？", "zh": "买的食物伴手礼还真多啊……翼，你买了什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_07_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e673df3bcd54cbafbd3d658780f7bbea020c5c0215b5d341e88b602a1ba30a06", "ja": "わたしは、家族の分のお土産です♪　あと未来と\n静香ちゃんと、劇場のみんなへのお土産と……。", "zh": "我买的是给家里人的特产♪　还有给未来、\n静香，以及剧场大家的特产……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_07_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "71432f698a139c32ed41fb1b67eb040b2967125e9982eef59fe552a088904f6b", "ja": "それと、私たちのチームに、\nお揃いのキーホルダーも買ったんですよ～♪", "zh": "还有给我们队伍买的同款钥匙扣哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_07_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8ee728942a282ff2be80f165be111b5021e8d0457f0f798dfaef7b893ea1ef93", "ja": "はい！　これは{$P$}さんの分！\nちゃんとつけてくださいね？", "zh": "好的！这是{$P$}先生的那份！\n要好好挂上哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_07_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b643eae1b6e015d2536681c3e3028d6a266eacc70a2b5e3387d2d7e9705b9b1b", "ja": "え？　俺の分も買ってくれたのか？", "zh": "诶？连我的那份也买了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_07_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "38519852a16ca61439af71ac0b781f93d3196597a3c43448fe84f67ea2ff1e45", "ja": "もちろん！　だって{$P$}さんも、\n一緒に旅をした仲間ですからね～。えへへ♪", "zh": "当然啦！毕竟{$P$}先生\n也是和我们一起旅行过的同伴嘛～。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_07_1017_021mat", "source_sha256": "f3794ad933c94b9388a1aad028929269fe87e0597f130b0dce5f3516cfc37fd5", "ja": "姫たちから{$P$}さんに、\n感謝の気持ちもこめているのです。", "zh": "里面也包含了公主们对{$P$}先生的\n感激之情哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_07_1018_p", "source_sha256": "feb49d7a78ef16c11442805a087cf9f3e8c79ccbc9633c1aab931e1b7c97b6fd", "ja": "そうか……なら、ありがたくいただくよ。", "zh": "这样啊……那我就不客气地收下了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_07_1019_p", "source_sha256": "6a0d8833f8a9b7676500c7775a776d4a012848b117bff9fa44915c7076f8a959", "ja": "さて、そろそろ移動しようか。\nみんな、忘れ物はないよな？", "zh": "那么，差不多该走了吧。\n大家都没忘带东西吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_07_1020_016tsu", "source_sha256": "df8baf04cbc098dac6ea217e3e6520e0e302867c81c2db7dc1ee93ecd077fc1c", "ja": "忘れ物？　それなら……。", "zh": "落下的东西？要说那个的话……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_07_1021_021mat", "source_sha256": "87a5177b26871c5dc6b28fc894f91018b953015b0fb15f51c6a453360c7b5636", "ja": "あるのです！", "zh": "有的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_07_1022_008tak", "source_sha256": "9dcd8cb5a85064650195fc6e8bcdbc3fa5dc15a9fbd8bba6dbc36ebde3fc621c", "ja": "あります。", "zh": "有的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_07_1023_020meg", "source_sha256": "1a4b0e19433535e8000f7004f4c4320d0535745c44dbfdce1a908e2a53d878b8", "ja": "あるある！", "zh": "对对对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_07_1024_p", "source_sha256": "8e76b11d6a7c889d5af9eff2838e3e17c8f69a1090351bd27cd4efac24b4c251", "ja": "ええっ！？\n全員忘れ物って、一体何を……。", "zh": "诶诶！？\n所有人都忘带东西了，到底忘了什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_07_1025_021mat", "source_sha256": "6e2aa3c6fa9a397e4cbbe2dc7563fd043e439fc1a9c34db0b9d775a4a49dae31", "ja": "だって姫たち、今回は海で泳げなかったのです。\nだから次は、忘れずに泳ぎたいのです～！", "zh": "因为公主们这次没能在海里游泳。\n所以下次一定要记得去游泳哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_07_1026_020meg", "source_sha256": "0814e65a043ed0725b3e0d1414a7f0fadcd98083f01004e9f1d3414d5e644e28", "ja": "南の名物、気になるの多すぎ！　全っ然心残りだから、\n今度来る時は、もっとゆっくり買い物しよ？", "zh": "南方的特产，感兴趣的也太多了！完全没逛够，心里还惦记着呢。下次来的时候，再慢慢买个够，好不好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_07_1027_008tak", "source_sha256": "0ce180408b84a528a60680c849d764101fdcb3f4949135fead0906539f71fb81", "ja": "ふふっ。再び、ここを訪れましょう。\n私達の、忘れ物を取りに。", "zh": "呵呵。我们再来这里吧。来取回我们遗落的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_07_1028_016tsu", "source_sha256": "35f2c536b45743bd7f4885fa7d467bebfdfcae34ba127c1188be46789236a367", "ja": "というわけで、絶対、みんなでまた来ましょうね♪\n約束ですよ～、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "所以说，大家一定要再一起来哦♪\n约好了～，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
